Vulnerability: CVE-2099-0001
Aliases: GHSA-aaaa-bbbb-cccc
Affected Maven package(s): org.example:example-lib 1.2.3

<advisory_summary>
Parser bypass in example-lib
</advisory_summary>

<advisory_details>
The Parser.parse method accepts crafted input.
</advisory_details>

The methods the fix touched, read from the source before and after the fix:

<fix_methods>
# commit https://github.com/example/lib/commit/abc1234 (on the analyzed release's line (tag v1.2.3))
- org.example.Parser#parse(Ljava/lang/String;)V: changed by the fix (declared before it); present in the analyzed classes
- org.example.Parser#unsafe(): removed by the fix (declared before it only); not in the analyzed classes
- org.example.Parser#check(String): added by the fix (not in the vulnerable release)
# commit https://github.com/example/lib/commit/def5678 (on another release line than the analyzed release (tag v1.2.3); not the fix of the analyzed release)
- org.example.Legacy#parse(): touched by the fix (pre-fix source unavailable)
</fix_methods>

The fix diff below contains only the non-test .java files changed by the fix commit(s).

<fix_diff>
# commit https://github.com/example/lib/commit/abc1234
diff --git a/java/org/example/Parser.java b/java/org/example/Parser.java
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/java/org/example/Parser.java
+++ b/java/org/example/Parser.java
@@ -10,3 +10,4 @@ public class Parser {
     void parse(String s) {
+        check(s);
     }
# commit https://github.com/example/lib/commit/def5678 (on another release line than the analyzed release (tag v1.2.3); not the fix of the analyzed release)
diff --git a/java/org/example/Parser.java b/java/org/example/Parser.java
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/java/org/example/Parser.java
+++ b/java/org/example/Parser.java
@@ -10,3 +10,4 @@ public class Parser {
     void parse(String s) {
+        check(s);
     }
</fix_diff>

Return the JSON object.